n some but not all child items are selected."},"241":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-37","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#checkbox-group","content":"Group multiple checkboxes together with a shared label."},"242":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-38","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#controlled","content":"Manage checkbox group state programmatically with controlled component pattern."},"243":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-39","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#horizontal-layout","content":"Display checkboxes in a horizontal row instead of vertical stack."},"244":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-40","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#disabled-states","content":"Individual checkboxes within a group can be disabled while others remain interactive."},"245":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-41","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#required-indicator","content":"Mark a checkbox group as required with visual indicator and validation."},"246":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-42","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#invalid-state","content":"Display error state and error message for validation feedback."},"247":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-43","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#customization","content":"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."},"248":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-44","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"249":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-45","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"250":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-46","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"251":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-47","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a checkbox field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive checkbox state:"},"252":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-48","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop displays a minus icon to represent a partial selection state. This is useful for \"select all\" checkboxes when only some items in a collection are selected."},"253":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-49","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"CheckboxGroup supports validation states and error messages:"},"254":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-50","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"},"255":{"id":"/docs/co