mpose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/components/select-18","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/components/select-19","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/components/select-20","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/components/select-21","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/components/select-22","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/components/select-23","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the