ides their contexts (e.g. `Modal`)\nthey adopt that parent's spacing automatically."},"1280":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-24","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#group","content":"Group is the bordered field box. Size and invalid/disabled chrome apply here."},"1281":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-25","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#corner-actions","content":"CornerActions is an always-visible structural region. Compose any actions inside it and use\nlayout props to reserve room beside the surrounding content."},"1282":{"id":"/docs/components/switch","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"page","content":"Switch","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-0","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch","content":"A binary toggle control that switches a setting between on and off states, communicated via the WAI-ARIA switch role."},"1284":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-1","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#features","content":"Features"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-2","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#installation","content":"Installation"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-3","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#examples","content":"Examples"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-4","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#default","content":"Default"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-5","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#switch-selected","content":"Switch Selected"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-6","p